%AMHorizOval*
0 Thick line with rounded ends*
0 $1 width*
0 $2 $3 position (X,Y) of the first rounded end (center of the circle)*
0 $4 $5 position (X,Y) of the second rounded end (center of the circle)*
0 Add line between two ends*
20,1,$1,$2,$3,$4,$5,0*
